  "title": "Wedding Planning Post-Event Review Form",
  "subtitle": "Compare the approved wedding plan with actual delivery, reconcile exceptions, capture stakeholder feedback, and assign measurable improvements.",
  "description": "An original post-event review for wedding operations. It links planned and actual timing, guest and service outcomes, supplier handoffs, inventory and incident records, client feedback, causal findings, corrective actions, and accountable closeout.",
  "use_case": "Use after the event record, incident reports, inventory logs, and supplier handoffs are available. Conduct the review with operating leads, separate verified evidence from opinion, and close when actions and client follow-up have named owners and due points.",
  "risk_tier": "A",
